  44          /************************************************************************
  45           * Function     : uart0_set_baud_rate
  46           * Description  : uart0 set baud rate
  47           * Input    : uint32_t clk_hz: cpu frequency
  48           *              uint32_t baud_rate: Series rate   Baud Rate = SYSCK/(16*(1024-S0REL))   SYSCK:RC16M           
